{"message":"Great! Next, please reboot your device to apply the new APN settings. You can do this by running:

reboot_device()

Don’t worry—this won’t affect your photos or other data. It just restarts your phone."}

{"message":"Great—now let’s make sure mobile data is enabled so MMS can work. Please run:

toggle_data()

Let me know once it’s turned on, and we’ll proceed with the next step."}

{"message":"Please first set your network mode preference on your phone to 4G/5G preferred. On your device, run:

set_network_mode_preference(mode="4g_5g_preferred")

Let me know once you’ve completed this step."}

{"message":"Great! Next, please grant the messaging app permission to send SMS/MMS. On your device, run:

grant_app_permission(app_name="messaging", permission="sms")

Let me know when you’ve completed this step."}

{"message":"Thanks! Now please toggle your mobile data on your device. Run:

toggle_data()

Let me know once you’ve done this."}

{"message":"Yes—that airplane icon means Airplane Mode is still ON. Please disable it by running:

toggle_airplane_mode()

Once that’s done, we’ll continue with the next step."}

{"message":"I’ve added 2 GB of mobile data to your line. Please enable mobile data by running:

toggle_data()

After that, check if you can send your picture messages."}

{"message":"Please enable Data Roaming on your device by running:

toggle_roaming()

Once that’s done, try sending your picture messages again and let me know if it works."}

{"message":"Let’s verify your APN’s MMS settings. Please run:

check_apn_settings()

and let me know what it shows for the MMSC URL field."}

{"message":"That MMSC URL looks correct for our network. Let’s run a quick diagnostic to confirm your phone can send MMS. Please execute:

can_send_mms()

and let me know what it reports."}

{"message":"Some devices can struggle to send MMS on 5G. Let’s force your phone onto 4G only. Please run:

set_network_mode_preference(mode="4g_only")

Then try sending an MMS again and let me know the result."}

{"message":"Please perform the following action on your device:

1. toggle_airplane_mode()

This will reset your phone’s wireless radios. Let me know once you’ve completed this step."}

{"message":"Great! Next, please perform the following action on your device:

2. set_network_mode_preference(mode=4g_5g_preferred)

This will allow your phone to connect to faster 4G/5G networks. Let me know when you’ve completed this step."}

{"message":"Great! Now, please perform the following action on your device:

3. reset_apn_settings()

This will restore your phone’s APN settings to the correct defaults for MMS. Let me know once you’ve completed this step."}

{"message":"Great! Now, please perform the following action on your device:

4. reboot_device()

This will apply the new APN settings and refresh your phone’s network connections. Let me know once you’ve rebooted your device."}

{"message":"Excellent. Finally, please perform the following action on your device:

5. grant_app_permission(app_name=messaging, permission=storage)

This will ensure the messaging app can access media files. After doing this, please try sending an MMS again and let me know if it works."}
